WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,740
If you don't need to use the monkey's digging ability to get out,

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,740
I really want to kill the monkey on the spot

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:08,620
Ever since I was little, no one has ever scolded me.

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:14,190
Feng Yi, you can kill the monkey for me.

5
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:16,430
How about you apologize to my girlfriend?

6
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:17,550
Forget it

7
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:19,460
I apologize

8
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,700
I didn't say anything wrong

9
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,060
Sorry

10
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,460
Okay Okay

11
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,700
Sorry, okay

12
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,050
That's ok

13
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:47,780
Be careful when you talk to me next time
